# Bump and publish

When the user says "bump and publish", release `@stom66/dcl-ui-component-kit` by following `DEVNOTES.md`. Run the gates below first. Do not bump, tag, push, or publish until both gates pass.

## Clean tree

Check `git status` before anything else. If the working tree has uncommitted changes (modified, staged, or untracked), stop and ask what to do with them.

## Bump level

Run `patch`, `minor`, or `major` only when the user named that level in the same message. Otherwise stop and ask which level to use.

## Then release

Once the tree is clean and the level is known, follow `DEVNOTES.md`:

1. `npm run bump:patch`, `npm run bump:minor`, or `npm run bump:major`
2. `git push && git push --tags`
3. `gh workflow run publish.yml`
4. Confirm the published version on npm

Use the GitHub Actions publish workflow. Do not publish from a local `/.npmrc` unless the user asks for that path.
